  "limitations": [
    "Not a WebView, CPAL, or listening test.",
    "25ms UI stalls every 2 seconds; 1ms native delivery; 1ms or 13ms reply delay; 4ms polling.",
    "512-frame device callbacks; FIFO packets; fixed 48kHz device. Longer stalls may still lose audio."
